     229/      C4 : 04                          INR  B                  ;COUNT DIGITS
     230/      C5 : C3 A8 00                    JMP  TN2                ;AND CONTINUE
     231/      C8 : AF                  TN4:    XRA  A                  ;TEST VALUE OF B
     232/      C9 : B0                          ORA  B                  ;AT LEAST ONE DIGIT
     233/      CA : C0                          RNZ                     ;MUST FOLLOW $ SIGN
     234/      CB : CD FC 00                    CALL  QHOW              ;ELSE IT'S ERROR
