    1899/     935 : FE 0D                       CPI  CR                 ;WAS LAST ONE A CR?
    1900/     937 : E1                          POP  H                  ;RETURN ADDRESS
    1901/     938 : CA B6 01                    JZ   RUNNXL             ;WAS CR, RUN NEXT LINE
