    1953/     98D : C1                  PN3:    POP  B                  ;WE GOT ALL DIGITS IN
    1954/     98E : 0D                  PN4:    DCR  C                  ;THE STACK
    1955/     98F : 79                          MOV  A,C                ;LOOK AT SPACE COUNT
    1956/     990 : B7                          ORA  A
